---
import site from '../../config/site.json';
---

<article class="site-article">
  <h1>Privacy &amp; project enquiries</h1>
  <h2>Information you share</h2>
  <p>
    Contact details and project information submitted through the enquiry form are used to respond
    to your enquiry and discuss the project.
  </p>
  <h2>Services used</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted on Cloudflare. Formspree processes contact form submissions and delivers
    them by email. Call bookings are handled by Cal.com. These services have their own privacy
    policies.
  </p>
  <h2>Questions and requests</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about information you have shared, or to request correction or deletion, email{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</article>
